  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> be two arithmetic means and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> be three geometric means of two distinct positive numbers. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the two numbers are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;are in AP.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Similarly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;are in GP.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
